39.42825,186.52174999999988],"code":"B3","env":[-1201.74,804.0,1233.13,-1.13,850.0,2351.74],"view":"section_B"},{"box":[295.2568475000095,183.5717499999999,303.88665249999053,189.47174999999987],"centre":[299.57175,186.52174999999988],"code":"B4","env":[1.13,804.0,1233.13,1201.74,850.0,2351.74],"view":"section_B"}],"door":{"angle":90,"left_out":["368101"],"pivot":[-966.5,-709.0],"unit":"360001"},"floor_lines":[{"label_at":[335.0,97.69999999999986],"view":"section_B","x0":205.0,"x1":334.0,"y":96.89999999999986},{"label_at":[142.00000000000003,97.59999999999984],"view":"section_A","x0":52.0,"x1":141.00000000000003,"y":96.79999999999984}],"floor_z":0.0,"mass":{"kg":"393.7","row":"Pod as shipped","source":"v2/05-Engineering/layout-study/weight-rollup.md","status":"calculation"},"notes":["Pod axes \(conventions section 4\): origin on the room floor at the pod's centre; +X right seen from outside facing the door, +Y back, +Z up; the front is the door side.","No floor and no threshold \(D-132\): people stand on the room floor, and the base stands on its glides \(glide_h 10, skeleton P04\).","Walls and ceiling are 84 deep: ACP 3, bond 3 \(D-137\), steel frame 40 \(D-131\), gap 4, lining cassette 34 \(skeleton P04, stack_t\). Seams 2.26 at a metal stop; the closing seams B1-B2, B3-B4 and C1-C2 have a 5.5 frame gap \(joints register 2.8\).","Still to come \(WALL\): the back upper panels B3 and B4 and their cassettes 510203 and 510204 are not modelled yet, so the back wall's upper half is empty in the views and sections; this sheet is drawn again when they are \(PM ruling 2026-11-01\).","Sections cut the teams' parts as modelled: A-A at X -373.5 \(the door's middle\), seen from the left; B-B at Y 0 \(mid depth\), seen from the front; C-C at Z 1000 \(through the door and the fixed glass\), seen from above. Each assembly's own sheets give its build-ups, fixings and sizes.","Inside sizes, measured on the teams' STEPs \(calculation\): width 2333 between the side linings at Z 1000 \(C-C\); depth 1461.1 from the closed door's inner face to the back lining at X -373.5 \(C-C\); clear height 2316.5 from the room floor to the ceiling cassettes' underside \(B-B\).","Door clear opening with the door open 90\\u00b0 outward \(calculation on FRONT's STEPs\): width 1156.6 at Z 115, 1032.5 at Z 1000 \(C-C\), 879.8 at Z 2089, from DL's hinge-side stop 351103 to the fixed glass's door edge \(the opening narrows upward with the door's slanted edge\); height 2094 under the door catch 368007 in DT \(A-A\). The hinge isn't named yet \(HOLD H01\): the leaf is turned about a pivot taken at X -966.5, Y -709 \(D-154's limit\), the hinges' HOLD spaces left out \(assumption\); the open leaf stays clear of these sizes.","Position codes \(guideline 5.1\), on the skeleton P04's panels: L1, L2 on the view from the left; R1, R2 on the view from the right; C1, C2 on the view from above; B1, B2, B3, B4 on section B-B. B3 and B4 aren't modelled yet \(WALL\); the pod has two ceiling halves, so there is no C3.","MASS 393.7 kg \(calculation\): the weight roll-up on skeleton P04 \(v2/05-Engineering/layout-study/weight-rollup.md, its 'Pod as shipped' row\): every part on the pod as it stands in the room, the parts that ship loose included; packaging not in it, nor the voice kit's reserve \(D-11\)."],"sizes":[{"along":"x","beam":null,"hi3d":[1166.5,300.0,1000.0],"hi_at":[1166.5,300.0,1000.0],"hi_pn":"510102","lo3d":[-1166.5,300.0,1000.0],"lo_at":[-1166.5,300.0,1000.0],"lo_pn":"510101","name":"inside width","open":false,"rotate":0,"start":[0.0,300.0,1000.0],"text":"INSIDE 2333","text_at":[462.50000000000006,190.19999999999987],"tips":[[404.17500000000007,189.39999999999986],[520.825,189.39999999999986]],"value":2333.0,"view":"section_C"},{"along":"y","beam":null,"hi3d":[-373.5,766.5,1000.0],"hi_at":[-373.5,766.5,1000.0],"hi_pn":"510201","lo3d":[-373.5,-694.62,1000.0],"lo_at":[-373.5,-694.62,1000.0],"lo_pn":"361001","name":"inside depth","open":false,"rotate":90,"start":[-373.5,0.0